Online Rental House Management System is a website where house admin, owners and customers can exchange information effectively and inexpensively. This Project also provide a user-friendly interface which satisfying the needs of the consumers. Employs a new strategy that facilitates easy management of rental house. Aim of this project is to save time and money of customers as well as owners. 
